# Once this became a git repo, Railway began honouring .gitignore as well — which excludes data/*.db and site/ because
# both are build products that must not be versioned. That silently shipped an image with no archive and no pages.
# Anything the running service needs is re-included here explicitly, and `npm run smoke` checks it after every deploy.
!data/record.db
!site
!site/**
data/pump.db*
data/seed.db*
data/archive.db*
data/reports
data/run.log
data/telegram.session
data/*.jsonl
site/t
site/w
site/api/t
site/api/w
node_modules
*.log
.env
.env.bak.*
